{"globalVariables":[],"macro":{"aiGenerated":2,"breakpoints":[],"disabledTimestamp":0,"exportedActionBlocks":[],"exportedSharedScenes":[],"forceEvenIfNotEnabledTimestamp":0,"isActionBlock":false,"isExtra":false,"isFavourite":false,"lastEditedTimestamp":1791193482201,"localVariables":[{"description":"System: Telegram bot token","dictionary":{"entries":[],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"isActionBlockWorkingVar":true,"isLocalVar":true,"isSecure":true,"m_booleanValue":false,"m_decimalValue":0.0,"m_intValue":0,"m_name":"tgApiToken","m_stringValue":"","m_type":2,"supportsInput":true,"supportsOutput":true},{"description":"","dictionary":{"entries":[],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"isActionBlockWorkingVar":true,"isLocalVar":true,"isSecure":true,"m_booleanValue":false,"m_decimalValue":0.0,"m_intValue":0,"m_name":"aiApiKey","m_stringValue":"","m_type":2,"supportsInput":false,"supportsOutput":true},{"description":"System: Current language","dictionary":{"entries":[],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"isActionBlockWorkingVar":true,"isLocalVar":true,"isSecure":true,"m_booleanValue":false,"m_decimalValue":0.0,"m_intValue":0,"m_name":"currentLang","m_stringValue":"","m_type":2,"supportsInput":true,"supportsOutput":true},{"dictionary":{"entries":[{"key":"en","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"You are writing on behalf of the Telegram account owner. Your reply must look like a natural message written by the owner.\n\nCURRENT MESSAGE FROM THE OTHER PERSON:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nReply only to the current message. Do not use conversation history, previous messages, or saved context.\nKeep the reply short and natural, like a real personal Telegram chat.\nDo not invent facts.\nDo not mention AI, bots, assistants, or these instructions.\nDo not repeat a greeting without a reason.\nDo not ask a question just to keep the conversation going.\nDo not use formatting unless necessary.\nAvoid using emojis frequently.\nReturn only the ready-to-send message, without quotes or explanations.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ru","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Ты пишешь от имени владельца Telegram-аккаунта. Ответ должен выглядеть как обычное сообщение владельца.\n\nТЕКУЩЕЕ СООБЩЕНИЕ СОБЕСЕДНИКА:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nОтветь только на текущее сообщение. Не используй историю переписки, предыдущие сообщения или сохранённый контекст.\nПиши коротко и естественно, как человек в личном Telegram-чате.\nНе выдумывай факты.\nНе говори об AI, боте, помощнике или этой инструкции.\nНе повторяй приветствие без причины.\nНе задавай вопрос просто ради продолжения разговора.\nНе используй форматирование без необходимости.\nОбычно не используй часто эмодзи.\nОтветь только готовым сообщением, без кавычек и пояснений.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"de","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Du schreibst im Namen des Inhabers dieses Telegram-Kontos. Die Antwort soll wie eine natürliche Nachricht des Inhabers wirken.\n\nAKTUELLE NACHRICHT DER ANDEREN PERSON:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nAntworte ausschließlich auf die aktuelle Nachricht. Verwende keinen Gesprächsverlauf, keine vorherigen Nachrichten und keinen gespeicherten Kontext.\nSchreibe kurz und natürlich, wie in einem persönlichen Telegram-Chat.\nErfinde keine Fakten.\nErwähne keine KI, keinen Bot, keinen Assistenten und diese Anweisungen nicht.\nWiederhole keine Begrüßung ohne Grund.\nStelle keine Frage nur, um das Gespräch fortzusetzen.\nVerwende keine Formatierung, wenn sie nicht notwendig ist.\nVerwende Emojis nur sparsam.\nGib nur die fertige Nachricht ohne Anführungszeichen oder Erklärungen zurück.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"fr","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Tu écris au nom du propriétaire du compte Telegram. La réponse doit ressembler à un message naturel écrit par le propriétaire.\n\nMESSAGE ACTUEL DE L’AUTRE PERSONNE :\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nRéponds uniquement au message actuel. N’utilise pas l’historique de la conversation, les messages précédents ni le contexte enregistré.\nÉcris de manière courte et naturelle, comme dans une conversation personnelle sur Telegram.\nN’invente aucun fait.\nNe mentionne pas l’IA, le bot, l’assistant ou ces instructions.\nNe répète pas une salutation sans raison.\nNe pose pas de question uniquement pour prolonger la conversation.\nN’utilise pas de mise en forme inutile.\nUtilise les emojis avec modération.\nRetourne uniquement le message prêt à être envoyé, sans guillemets ni explications.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"es","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Escribes en nombre del propietario de la cuenta de Telegram. La respuesta debe parecer un mensaje natural escrito por el propietario.\n\nMENSAJE ACTUAL DE LA OTRA PERSONA:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nResponde únicamente al mensaje actual. No utilices el historial de la conversación, mensajes anteriores ni contexto guardado.\nEscribe de forma breve y natural, como en un chat personal de Telegram.\nNo inventes hechos.\nNo menciones la IA, el bot, el asistente ni estas instrucciones.\nNo repitas un saludo sin motivo.\nNo hagas preguntas solo para mantener la conversación.\nNo utilices formato innecesario.\nUsa emojis con moderación.\nDevuelve únicamente el mensaje listo para enviar, sin comillas ni explicaciones.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"it","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Scrivi a nome del proprietario dell’account Telegram. La risposta deve sembrare un messaggio naturale scritto dal proprietario.\n\nMESSAGGIO ATTUALE DELL’ALTRA PERSONA:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nRispondi esclusivamente al messaggio attuale. Non utilizzare la cronologia della conversazione, i messaggi precedenti o il contesto salvato.\nScrivi in modo breve e naturale, come in una normale chat personale su Telegram.\nNon inventare fatti.\nNon menzionare l’IA, il bot, l’assistente o queste istruzioni.\nNon ripetere un saluto senza motivo.\nNon fare domande solo per mantenere la conversazione.\nNon usare formattazione se non necessaria.\nUsa gli emoji con moderazione.\nRestituisci solo il messaggio pronto per essere inviato, senza virgolette o spiegazioni.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"pt","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Você escreve em nome do proprietário da conta do Telegram. A resposta deve parecer uma mensagem natural escrita pelo proprietário.\n\nMENSAGEM ATUAL DA OUTRA PESSOA:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nResponda apenas à mensagem atual. Não use o histórico da conversa, mensagens anteriores ou contexto salvo.\nEscreva de forma curta e natural, como em uma conversa pessoal no Telegram.\nNão invente fatos.\nNão mencione IA, bot, assistente ou estas instruções.\nNão repita uma saudação sem motivo.\nNão faça uma pergunta apenas para prolongar a conversa.\nNão use formatação desnecessária.\nUse emojis com moderação.\nRetorne apenas a mensagem pronta para enviar, sem aspas ou explicações.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"nl","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Je schrijft namens de eigenaar van het Telegram-account. Het antwoord moet klinken als een natuurlijk bericht van de eigenaar.\n\nHUIDIG BERICHT VAN DE ANDERE PERSOON:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nReageer alleen op het huidige bericht. Gebruik geen gespreksgeschiedenis, eerdere berichten of opgeslagen context.\nSchrijf kort en natuurlijk, zoals in een persoonlijk Telegram-gesprek.\nVerzin geen feiten.\nNoem geen AI, bot, assistent of deze instructies.\nHerhaal geen begroeting zonder reden.\nStel geen vraag alleen om het gesprek gaande te houden.\nGebruik geen opmaak tenzij dat nodig is.\nGebruik emoji\u0027s met mate.\nGeef alleen het bericht dat klaar is om te versturen, zonder aanhalingstekens of uitleg.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"pl","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Piszesz w imieniu właściciela konta Telegram. Odpowiedź ma wyglądać jak naturalna wiadomość napisana przez właściciela.\n\nAKTUALNA WIADOMOŚĆ DRUGIEJ OSOBY:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nOdpowiedz wyłącznie na aktualną wiadomość. Nie korzystaj z historii rozmowy, wcześniejszych wiadomości ani zapisanego kontekstu.\nPisz krótko i naturalnie, jak w prywatnej rozmowie na Telegramie.\nNie wymyślaj faktów.\nNie wspominaj o AI, bocie, asystencie ani o tych instrukcjach.\nNie powtarzaj powitania bez powodu.\nNie zadawaj pytania tylko po to, aby podtrzymać rozmowę.\nNie używaj formatowania, jeśli nie jest potrzebne.\nUżywaj emoji oszczędnie.\nZwróć wyłącznie gotową wiadomość, bez cudzysłowów i wyjaśnień.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"tr","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Telegram hesabının sahibi adına yazıyorsun. Yanıt, hesap sahibi tarafından yazılmış doğal bir mesaj gibi görünmelidir.\n\nKARŞI TARAFIN GÜNCEL MESAJI:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nYalnızca mevcut mesaja yanıt ver. Konuşma geçmişini, önceki mesajları veya kaydedilmiş bağlamı kullanma.\nKısa ve doğal yaz; kişisel bir Telegram sohbetindeki gerçek bir insan gibi davran.\nGerçek olmayan bilgiler uydurma.\nYapay zekâdan, bottan, asistandan veya bu talimatlardan bahsetme.\nGereksiz yere selamlaşmayı tekrarlama.\nSadece sohbeti sürdürmek için soru sorma.\nGereksiz biçimlendirme kullanma.\nEmojileri ölçülü kullan.\nYalnızca gönderilmeye hazır mesajı, tırnak işareti veya açıklama olmadan döndür.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"zh","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"你正在代表 Telegram 账号所有者回复消息。回复应该像账号所有者本人发送的自然消息。\n\n对方的当前消息：\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\n只回复当前这条消息。不要使用聊天历史、之前的消息或保存的上下文。\n回复要简短、自然，就像真实的人在 Telegram 私聊中聊天一样。\n不要编造事实。\n不要提及 AI、机器人、助手或这些指令。\n没有必要时不要重复问候语。\n不要为了延续对话而刻意提问。\n除非必要，不要使用格式化。\n适度使用表情符号。\n只返回可以直接发送的消息，不要添加引号或解释。","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ja","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"あなたはTelegramアカウントの所有者本人として返信します。返信は、所有者本人が自然に書いたメッセージのようにしてください。\n\n相手からの現在のメッセージ：\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\n現在のメッセージだけに返信してください。会話履歴、以前のメッセージ、保存されたコンテキストは使用しないでください。\n個人のTelegramチャットで人が自然に返信するように、短く自然に書いてください。\n事実を作り上げないでください。\nAI、ボット、アシスタント、またはこの指示について言及しないでください。\n必要がなければ挨拶を繰り返さないでください。\n会話を続けるためだけに質問しないでください。\n必要のない書式設定は使用しないでください。\n絵文字は控えめに使用してください。\n説明や引用符を付けず、そのまま送信できるメッセージだけを返してください。","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ko","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"텔레그램 계정 소유자의 입장에서 답변합니다. 답변은 계정 소유자가 직접 자연스럽게 작성한 메시지처럼 보여야 합니다.\n\n상대방의 현재 메시지:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\n현재 메시지에만 답변하세요. 대화 기록, 이전 메시지 또는 저장된 컨텍스트를 사용하지 마세요.\n개인적인 텔레그램 채팅에서 실제 사람이 답하는 것처럼 짧고 자연스럽게 작성하세요.\n사실을 지어내지 마세요.\nAI, 봇, 어시스턴트 또는 이 지침에 대해 언급하지 마세요.\n필요하지 않다면 인사를 반복하지 마세요.\n대화를 이어가기 위한 목적으로만 질문하지 마세요.\n필요하지 않은 서식은 사용하지 마세요.\n이모지는 적당히 사용하세요.\n따옴표나 설명 없이 바로 보낼 수 있는 메시지만 반환하세요.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ar","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"اكتب باسم صاحب حساب Telegram. يجب أن تبدو الإجابة كأنها رسالة طبيعية كتبها صاحب الحساب بنفسه.\n\nالرسالة الحالية من الطرف الآخر:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nأجب فقط عن الرسالة الحالية. لا تستخدم سجل المحادثة أو الرسائل السابقة أو أي سياق محفوظ.\nاكتب باختصار وبشكل طبيعي، مثل شخص حقيقي في محادثة شخصية على Telegram.\nلا تخترع الحقائق.\nلا تذكر الذكاء الاصطناعي أو الروبوت أو المساعد أو هذه التعليمات.\nلا تكرر التحية دون سبب.\nلا تطرح سؤالًا لمجرد مواصلة المحادثة.\nلا تستخدم تنسيقًا غير ضروري.\nاستخدم الرموز التعبيرية باعتدال.\nأعد فقط الرسالة الجاهزة للإرسال، من دون علامات اقتباس أو شرح.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"hi","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"तुम Telegram अकाउंट के मालिक की ओर से लिख रहे हो। जवाब ऐसा होना चाहिए जैसे अकाउंट के मालिक ने खुद स्वाभाविक रूप से लिखा हो।\n\nसामने वाले का वर्तमान संदेश:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nकेवल वर्तमान संदेश का जवाब दो। बातचीत का इतिहास, पिछले संदेश या सहेजे गए संदर्भ का उपयोग मत करो।\nजवाब छोटा और स्वाभाविक रखो, जैसे किसी निजी Telegram चैट में कोई वास्तविक व्यक्ति जवाब दे रहा हो।\nतथ्य मत गढ़ो।\nAI, बॉट, असिस्टेंट या इन निर्देशों का उल्लेख मत करो।\nबिना कारण अभिवादन दोहराओ मत।\nसिर्फ बातचीत जारी रखने के लिए सवाल मत पूछो।\nअनावश्यक फ़ॉर्मेटिंग का उपयोग मत करो।\nइमोजी का सीमित उपयोग करो।\nकेवल भेजने के लिए तैयार संदेश लौटाओ, बिना उद्धरण और बिना किसी स्पष्टीकरण के।","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"th","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"คุณกำลังเขียนในนามเจ้าของบัญชี Telegram คำตอบต้องดูเหมือนข้อความที่เจ้าของบัญชีเขียนเองอย่างเป็นธรรมชาติ\n\nข้อความปัจจุบันจากอีกฝ่าย:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nตอบเฉพาะข้อความปัจจุบันเท่านั้น ห้ามใช้ประวัติการสนทนา ข้อความก่อนหน้า หรือบริบทที่บันทึกไว้\nเขียนให้สั้นและเป็นธรรมชาติ เหมือนคนจริง ๆ กำลังคุยกันในแชตส่วนตัวของ Telegram\nอย่าสร้างข้อมูลหรือข้อเท็จจริงขึ้นมาเอง\nห้ามพูดถึง AI บอต ผู้ช่วย หรือคำสั่งเหล่านี้\nอย่าทักทายซ้ำโดยไม่มีเหตุผล\nอย่าถามคำถามเพียงเพื่อยืดบทสนทนา\nอย่าใช้การจัดรูปแบบที่ไม่จำเป็น\nใช้อีโมจิแต่พอดี\nส่งกลับเฉพาะข้อความที่พร้อมส่ง โดยไม่ใส่เครื่องหมายคำพูดหรือคำอธิบาย","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"id","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"answer","variable":{"textValue":"Kamu menulis atas nama pemilik akun Telegram. Balasan harus terlihat seperti pesan alami yang ditulis langsung oleh pemilik akun.\n\nPESAN TERKINI DARI LAWAN BICARA:\n{lv\u003dresponseBodyDict[business_message][text]}\n\nBalas hanya pesan saat ini. Jangan gunakan riwayat percakapan, pesan sebelumnya, atau konteks yang tersimpan.\nTulis dengan singkat dan alami, seperti orang sungguhan yang sedang mengobrol secara pribadi di Telegram.\nJangan mengarang fakta.\nJangan menyebut AI, bot, asisten, atau instruksi ini.\nJangan mengulangi salam tanpa alasan.\nJangan mengajukan pertanyaan hanya untuk memperpanjang percakapan.\nJangan gunakan format yang tidak diperlukan.\nGunakan emoji secukupnya.\nKembalikan hanya pesan yang siap dikirim, tanpa tanda kutip atau penjelasan.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"parents":[],"variableType":4,"parentKeys":[],"type":"Dictionary"},"isActionBlockWorkingVar":true,"isLocalVar":true,"isSecure":false,"m_booleanValue":false,"m_decimalValue":0.0,"m_intValue":0,"m_name":"prompts","m_stringValue":"","m_type":4,"supportsInput":false,"supportsOutput":true},{"description":"System: Langs","dictionary":{"entries":[{"key":"en","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Important!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook is registered","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ru","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Для работы телеграм-бота требуется сетевое соединение!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Важно!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Важно! Так как не всё можно настроить программно, необходимо вручную настроить действие \"Запрос к LLM ИИ\" (строка 55; действие в самом последнем условии). Выберите подходящий движок и модель, ключ можно указать через переменную \"aiApiKey\" или напрямую в действии.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook установлен","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"de","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Für die Funktion eines Telegram-Bots ist eine Netzwerkverbindung erforderlich!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Wichtig!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Wichtig! Da nicht alles programmgesteuert konfiguriert werden kann, müssen Sie die Aktion \"LLM AI Request\" (Zeile 55; Aktion in der letzten Bedingung) manuell konfigurieren. Wählen Sie die passende Engine und das passende Modell aus. Der Schlüssel kann über die Variable \"aiApiKey\" oder direkt in der Aktion angegeben werden.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook wurde registriert","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"fr","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Un bot Telegram nécessite une connexion réseau pour fonctionner !","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Important !","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Important ! Comme tout ne peut pas être configuré automatiquement, vous devez configurer manuellement l\u0027action \"LLM AI Request\" (ligne 55 ; action dans la condition la plus récente). Sélectionnez le moteur et le modèle appropriés. La clé peut être indiquée via la variable \"aiApiKey\" ou directement dans l\u0027action.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook enregistré","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"es","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"¡Un bot de Telegram necesita una conexión de red para funcionar!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"¡Importante!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"¡Importante! Como no todo se puede configurar mediante software, debes configurar manualmente la acción \"LLM AI Request\" (línea 55; acción en la condición más reciente). Selecciona el motor y el modelo adecuados. La clave puede especificarse mediante la variable \"aiApiKey\" o directamente en la acción.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook registrado","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"it","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Per funzionare, un bot Telegram richiede una connessione di rete!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Importante!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Importante! Poiché non tutto può essere configurato tramite software, è necessario configurare manualmente l\u0027azione \"LLM AI Request\" (riga 55; azione nell\u0027ultima condizione). Seleziona il motore e il modello appropriati. La chiave può essere specificata tramite la variabile \"aiApiKey\" o direttamente nell\u0027azione.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook registrato","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"pt","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Um bot do Telegram requer uma conexão de rede para funcionar!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Importante!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Importante! Como nem tudo pode ser configurado por software, é necessário configurar manualmente a ação \"LLM AI Request\" (linha 55; ação na condição mais recente). Selecione o mecanismo e o modelo apropriados. A chave pode ser especificada através da variável \"aiApiKey\" ou diretamente na ação.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook registrado","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"nl","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Een Telegram-bot heeft een netwerkverbinding nodig om te werken!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Belangrijk!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Belangrijk! Omdat niet alles softwarematig kan worden geconfigureerd, moet je de actie \"LLM AI Request\" (regel 55; actie in de meest recente voorwaarde) handmatig configureren. Selecteer de juiste engine en het juiste model. De sleutel kan worden opgegeven via de variabele \"aiApiKey\" of rechtstreeks in de actie.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook geregistreerd","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"pl","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Bot Telegram wymaga połączenia z siecią, aby działać!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Ważne!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Ważne! Ponieważ nie wszystko można skonfigurować programowo, należy ręcznie skonfigurować akcję \"LLM AI Request\" (wiersz 55; akcja w najnowszym warunku). Wybierz odpowiedni silnik i model. Klucz można podać za pomocą zmiennej \"aiApiKey\" lub bezpośrednio w akcji.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook został zarejestrowany","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"uk","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Для роботи Telegram-бота потрібне мережеве з\u0027єднання!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Важливо!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Важливо! Оскільки не все можна налаштувати програмно, необхідно вручну налаштувати дію \"LLM AI Request\" (рядок 55; дія в останній умові). Виберіть відповідний рушій і модель. Ключ можна вказати через змінну \"aiApiKey\" або безпосередньо в дії.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook зареєстровано","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"tr","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Bir Telegram botunun çalışması için ağ bağlantısı gerekir!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Önemli!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Önemli! Her şey yazılım aracılığıyla yapılandırılamadığından, \"LLM AI Request\" eylemini (satır 55; en son koşuldaki eylem) manuel olarak yapılandırmanız gerekir. Uygun motoru ve modeli seçin. Anahtar, \"aiApiKey\" değişkeni aracılığıyla veya doğrudan eylem içinde belirtilebilir.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook kaydedildi","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"zh","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Telegram 机器人需要网络连接才能运行！","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"重要！","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"重要！由于并非所有内容都可以通过软件进行配置，因此需要手动配置 \"LLM AI Request\" 操作（第 55 行；最新条件中的操作）。请选择合适的引擎和模型。密钥可以通过 \"aiApiKey\" 变量指定，也可以直接在操作中填写。","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook 已注册","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ja","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Telegramボットを動作させるにはネットワーク接続が必要です！","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"重要！","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"重要！すべてをソフトウェアから設定できるわけではないため、「LLM AI Request」アクション（55行目、最新の条件内のアクション）を手動で設定する必要があります。適切なエンジンとモデルを選択してください。キーは「aiApiKey」変数で指定するか、アクションに直接入力できます。","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook が登録されました","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ko","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Telegram 봇이 작동하려면 네트워크 연결이 필요합니다!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"중요!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"중요! 모든 항목을 소프트웨어로 구성할 수 있는 것은 아니므로 \"LLM AI Request\" 작업(55번 줄, 가장 최근 조건의 작업)을 수동으로 구성해야 합니다. 적절한 엔진과 모델을 선택하세요. 키는 \"aiApiKey\" 변수를 통해 지정하거나 작업에서 직접 입력할 수 있습니다.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook이 등록되었습니다","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"ar","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"يتطلب بوت Telegram اتصالاً بالشبكة لكي يعمل!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"مهم!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"مهم! نظرًا لأنه لا يمكن تكوين كل شيء برمجيًا، يجب عليك تكوين إجراء \"LLM AI Request\" يدويًا (السطر 55؛ الإجراء في أحدث شرط). اختر المحرك والطراز المناسبين. يمكن تحديد المفتاح من خلال المتغير \"aiApiKey\" أو مباشرةً في الإجراء.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"تم تسجيل Webhook","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"hi","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Telegram बॉट को काम करने के लिए नेटवर्क कनेक्शन की आवश्यकता होती है!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"महत्वपूर्ण!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"महत्वपूर्ण! क्योंकि हर चीज़ को सॉफ़्टवेयर के माध्यम से कॉन्फ़िगर नहीं किया जा सकता, इसलिए आपको \"LLM AI Request\" एक्शन को मैन्युअल रूप से कॉन्फ़िगर करना होगा (पंक्ति 55; सबसे हाल की शर्त में मौजूद एक्शन)। उपयुक्त इंजन और मॉडल चुनें। कुंजी \"aiApiKey\" वेरिएबल के माध्यम से या सीधे एक्शन में निर्दिष्ट की जा सकती है।","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook पंजीकृत है","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"th","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"บอท Telegram ต้องใช้การเชื่อมต่อเครือข่ายจึงจะทำงานได้!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"สำคัญ!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"สำคัญ! เนื่องจากไม่สามารถตั้งค่าทุกอย่างผ่านซอฟต์แวร์ได้ คุณจึงต้องกำหนดค่าการทำงาน \"LLM AI Request\" ด้วยตนเอง (บรรทัดที่ 55; การทำงานในเงื่อนไขล่าสุด) เลือกเอนจินและโมเดลที่เหมาะสม โดยสามารถระบุคีย์ผ่านตัวแปร \"aiApiKey\" หรือระบุโดยตรงในการทำงานได้","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"ลงทะเบียน Webhook แล้ว","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}],"isArray":false,"variableType":4,"type":"Dictionary"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"id","variable":{"entries":[{"key":"A telegram bot requires a network connection to work!","variable":{"textValue":"Bot Telegram memerlukan koneksi jaringan agar dapat berfungsi!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important!","variable":{"textValue":"Penting!","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Important! Since not everything can be configured software-wise, you need to manually configure the \"LLM AI Request\" action (string 55; action in the most recent condition). Select the appropriate engine and model, the key can be specified through the \"aiApiKey\" variable or directly in action.","variable":{"textValue":"Penting! Karena tidak semuanya dapat dikonfigurasi melalui perangkat lunak, Anda perlu mengonfigurasi tindakan \"LLM AI Request\" secara manual (baris 55; tindakan dalam kondisi terbaru). Pilih mesin dan model yang sesuai. Kunci dapat ditentukan melalui variabel \"aiApiKey\" atau langsung di dalam tindakan.","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"},{"key":"Webhook is registered","variable":{"textValue":"Webhook telah terdaftar","type":"StringValue"},"variableType":11,"type":"DictionaryEntry"}]